    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a resource source in the landscape. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_resource_source" kindref="compound">ResourceSource</ref> extends <ref refid="class_path_source" kindref="compound">PathSource</ref> to manage information about a specific resource species, including its maximum capacity, edible fraction, growth dynamics, and whether it spreads in patches across the landscape. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
